### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### Phase 6 — Dashboard Summary Test Suite
### Sovva Backend (.NET 8)
###
### Endpoint: GET /api/Users/dashboard-summary
### Controller: UsersController → DashboardService.GetDashboardSummaryAsync
###
### This endpoint aggregates 5 sequential DB queries:
###   1. User profile (cached 5 min)
###   2. Wallet balance
###   3. Recent transactions (last 20)
###   4. Active subscriptions (active=true, within date range)
###   5. Tomorrow's scheduled orders (status=Scheduled only)
###
### Response caching: 60s via [ResponseCache] VaryByHeader=Authorization
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5257
