### 1. DASHBOARD — Happy Path
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 1.1 GET dashboard-summary — full validation ────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK → DashboardSummaryDto
###
### RESPONSE SCHEMA CHECK (verify ALL fields present):
###
### {
###   "profile": {
###     "userId": int,        ✅ Real — from DB
###     "name": string,       ✅ Real — NOTE: field is "name", NOT "fullName"
###     "email": string,      ✅ Real — from DB
###     "phone": string|null, ✅ Real — from DB
###     "accountStatus": str, ✅ Real — from DB
###     "walletBalance": dec, ✅ Real — from DB user.WalletBalance
###     "role": string,       ✅ Real — "User" or "Admin"
###     "createdAt": datetime, ✅ Real
###     "updatedAt": datetime, ✅ Real
###     "profileComplete": bool ✅ Computed — name && phone both non-empty
###   },
###   "walletBalance": decimal,         ✅ Real — from wallet_transactions SUM
###   "recentTransactions": [           ✅ Real — last 20 transactions
###     {
###       "transactionId": long,
###       "userId": int,
###       "amount": decimal,
###       "type": string,               // "Credit" or "Debit"
###       "description": string,
###       "createdAt": datetime
###     }
###   ],
###   "activeSubscriptions": [          ✅ Real — but MISSING fields (see below)
###     {
###       "subscriptionId": int,
###       "userId": int,
###       "userMealId": int,            // ✅ Present
###       "frequency": int/string,
###       "startDate": dateonly,
###       "endDate": dateonly,
###       "active": true,
###       "nextScheduledDate": dateonly|null,
###       "userName": string,
###       "mealName": string,
###       "mealPrice": decimal,
###       "weeklySchedule": [],
###       // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: mealId — NOT mapped in DashboardService L151-172
###       // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: imageUrl — NOT mapped in DashboardService L151-172
###       // Frontend needs mealId for navigation and imageUrl for display
###     }
###   ],
###   "tomorrowOrders": [               ✅ Real — tomorrow's Scheduled orders
###     {
###       "scheduledOrderId": int,
###       "mealName": string,
###       "mealId": int|null,           ✅ Real — from scheduled_order snapshot
###       "mealImageUrl": string|null,  ✅ Real — from scheduled_order snapshot
###       "scheduledFor": datetime,
###       "deliveryTimeSlot": string,
###       "totalPrice": decimal,
###       "orderStatus": "Scheduled",
###       "canModify": bool,
###       "subscriptionId": int|null,
###       "ingredients": []
###     }
###   ],
###   "totalTransactions": 0,     // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
###   "currentStreak": 0,         // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
###   "bestStreak": 0,            // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
###   "loyaltyPoints": 0,         // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
###   "averageCarbs": 0,          // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
###   "averageFats": 0            // SUSPECTED PLACEHOLDER: never set in DashboardService
### }

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/dashboard-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AFTER RUNNING, CHECK:
###
### ✅ profile.name — should be non-null string (NOT "fullName")
### ✅ profile.walletBalance — should match walletBalance (top-level)
### ✅ walletBalance — decimal > 0 (if topped up in phase4)
### ✅ recentTransactions — array length > 0 (if topped up in phase4)
### ✅ activeSubscriptions — array length > 0 (if created in phase5)
### ✅ tomorrowOrders — array length > 0 (if subscription active with tomorrow order)
###
### ⚠️ KNOWN PLACEHOLDERS (always return 0):
###   - totalTransactions: NEVER SET (DashboardService L81-101 omits it)
###   - currentStreak: NEVER SET
###   - bestStreak: NEVER SET
###   - loyaltyPoints: NEVER SET
###   - averageCarbs: NEVER SET
###   - averageFats: NEVER SET
###
### ⚠️ MISSING FIELDS in activeSubscriptions:
###   - mealId: Dashboard maps userMealId but NOT mealId
###   - imageUrl: not mapped at all
###   Frontend LocationService uses mealId for "View Meal" navigation

###


