### 3. COMPARISON TESTS — Verify dashboard matches individual endpoints
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 3.1 GET profile — compare with dashboard.profile ───────────
### Expected: 200 OK → UserDto
### VERIFY: All fields match dashboard.profile exactly

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─── 3.2 GET wallet balance — compare with dashboard.walletBalance
### Expected: 200 OK → { balance, userId }
### VERIFY: balance == dashboard.walletBalance

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-balance HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─── 3.3 GET transactions — compare with dashboard.recentTransactions
### Expected: 200 OK → array
### VERIFY: first 20 match dashboard.recentTransactions (same order)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/my-transactions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─── 3.4 GET active subscriptions — compare with dashboard.activeSubscriptions
### Expected: 200 OK → array
### VERIFY: count matches, subscription IDs match
### NOTE: Dashboard may have FEWER fields than the direct endpoint
###       (missing mealId, imageUrl in dashboard mapping)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Subscriptions/active HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─── 3.5 GET tomorrow orders — compare with dashboard.tomorrowOrders
### Expected: 200 OK → array of ScheduledOrderResponseDto
### VERIFY: count matches, only Scheduled status

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ScheduledOrders/tomorrow HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. CACHING BEHAVIOR
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ─── 4.1 Top up wallet then immediately check dashboard ─────────
### The profile is cached for 5 minutes.
### The dashboard response is cached for 60 seconds.
### After top-up:
###   - walletBalance should update (NOT cached, fresh query)
###   - profile.walletBalance MAY be stale (5-min profile cache)
###   - recentTransactions should include the new top-up

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WalletTransactions/topup HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 1.00,
    "description": "Cache test top-up"
}

###

### ─── 4.2 Immediately fetch dashboard ────────────────────────────
### Expected: 200 OK
### CHECK:
###   ✅ walletBalance includes the ₹1 (fresh from wallet repo)
###   ⚠️ profile.walletBalance may NOT include the ₹1 (5-min cache)
###   ✅ recentTransactions[0] should be "Cache test top-up"

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Users/dashboard-summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### NOTE: If profile.walletBalance != walletBalance, this confirms
### the cache inconsistency. The frontend should use top-level
### walletBalance, not profile.walletBalance.

###


